      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know who i am anymore. everything i was... the training, the meets, the way my body actually felt like it belonged to me. now it just feels like i'm piloting a broken machine. it’s like the person i actually was died when my knee gave out. i'm just the leftover parts.",
