    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to \"rediscover\" something that feels like it's just... gone. there's no one left to find. when i look in the mirror i don't see a person, i just see this hollow shell of what used to be there. it feels like the real me finished her story and left, and now i'm just stuck inhabiting the aftermath. it's just a void.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
